            "title": "Chez Écrin (1BHK - Near Bagmane/BTP, CV Raman Nagar)",
            "summary": "Check photos on Airbnb website. Come back here for discount on direct&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"true\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\"> </div></div>\n<div data-is-empty=\"true\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">Check photos on <a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1756013534955252607?adults=1&amp;s=67&amp;unique_share_id=1afdec7f-f351-4f61-a71b-aee4a357e0aa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Airbnb website</a>. Come back here for discount on direct booking.</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding: 25px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px;\"><address><strong>Chez Écrin /ʃeɪ eɪˈkræn/</strong></address><address><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">ORIGIN: French inspired</span></address><address>    1. <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">a home that holds what matters</span></address><address>    2. a little setting for life’s treasures</address><address>\n<p>A thoughtful name that evokes the tenderness of keeping something precious close. Beautifully furnished and comforting, it makes room for the little things that turn a stay into a memory. Where ordinary moments become little treasures.</p>\n</address></div>\n<div class=\"post__toc\">\n<h3>Jump to section:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb86h5eec0\">Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85gmavbp\">Availability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb884ddhdj\">Location / Landmark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85eftdbg\">Amenities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85eftdbh\">House Rules</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85gmavbq\">Check-in and check-out</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb86h5eec0\">Price</h2>\n<p>Minimum booking duration: 2 days (mandatory).</p>\n<p>For Direct Bookings: INR (Indian Rupees) 2500 per night (for stays less than 7 days).</p>\n<p>Planning to stay for long term? We offer discounts for longer stays (based on stay duration as well as amenities needed). Please <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918982732654&amp;text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20*Chez%20Soi%20(1BHK%20in%20CV%20Raman%20Nagar)*%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fserenivue.com%2Fchez-soi-1bhk-in-cv-raman-nagar.html%0A%0APrimary%20guest%20name%3A%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20guests%3A%20%0A%0ACheck-in%20date%3A%20%0A%0ACheckout%20date%3A%20%0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">connect with us on Whatsapp Chat</a> so that we can discuss the same. </p>\n<p>Important points to keep in mind:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can pay via UPI (if you are from India) or via Paypal (if you are based outside India). Cash payments are not accepted.</li>\n<li>There is no security deposit, but 100% of amount needs to be paid before checkin.</li>\n<li><strong>Refunds and cancellations</strong>: No cancellation and no refunds on direct bookings via this website. If you want a refundable booking, please book via Airbnb as the Airbnb listing for this house has an option for refundable booking (with Airbnb taking charge of enforcing the cancellation policy as well as process refunds).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85gmavbp\">Availability</h2>\n<p>Due to proximity of this flat to key work center (Bagmane Tech Park, CV Raman Nagar), many of our guests end up extending their stay in this property depending on their work commitments. </p>\n<p>You can message us on <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918982732654&amp;text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20*Chez%20Soi%20(1BHK%20in%20CV%20Raman%20Nagar)*%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fserenivue.com%2Fchez-soi-1bhk-in-cv-raman-nagar.html%0A%0APrimary%20guest%20name%3A%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20guests%3A%20%0A%0ACheck-in%20date%3A%20%0A%0ACheckout%20date%3A%20%0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Whatsapp with your check-in and checkout dates</a> and we will share availability with you.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\">This house on Airbnb:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Average Rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Checkout <a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1756013534955252607?adults=1&amp;s=67&amp;unique_share_id=66609699-fc62-49ab-8763-7e3b18de8050\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Airbnb listing</a>.</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\">\n<p>Hosted by: <strong>Amber Jain</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>SUPERHOST (on Airbnb)</li>\n<li class=\"align-left\"><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/users/profile/1468170512243225483\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My Airbnb Host Profile</a></li>\n<li class=\"align-left\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/amberjain/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My Linkedin Profile</a></li>\n<li class=\"align-left\">I speak English and Hindi</li>\n</ul>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://amberja.in/media/posts/24/responsive/Amber-Jain-md.jpg\" alt=\"Amber Jain\" data-is-external-image=\"true\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb884ddhdj\">Location / Landmark</h2>\n<p>The house is located 280 meters away from Bagmane Tech Park, CV Raman Nagar on 4th Cross Road. <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/4uE5aVuWnsm1qDnQ7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Maps Link.</a></p>\n<p>You can use Google Maps to calculate walking/cab distance to any other location in Bangalore (e.g. your office).<a href=\"https://share.google/UD6XmeS2n3ncYq9Qr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p>For security reasons, the flat/house number will be shared (in booking confirmation email) only after the payment is done for the booking.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85eftdbg\">Amenities</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Two seater Sofa-cum-bed.</li>\n<li>Double queen-sized bed.</li>\n<li>32 inch TV with OTT</li>\n<li>Wifi</li>\n<li>Inverter</li>\n<li>Aquaguard</li>\n<li>Front Load Washing machine</li>\n<li>Geyser</li>\n<li>Electric steam iron</li>\n<li>Hair dryer.</li>\n<li>Kitchen with induction stove and all cooking utensils</li>\n<li>Fridge</li>\n<li>Microwave</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85gmavbq\">Check-in and check-out</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in: 12pm</li>\n<li>Check-out: 10am</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Early check-in and late check-out are at the host’s discretion, depending on other bookings. These requests will only be confirmed 24-48 hours before the relevant check-in or check-out day, as we have to wait until the last moment to see if the room is getting booked by anyone else.</p>\n<h2>Airbnb listing</h2>\n<div class=\"airbnb-embed-frame\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 300px; margin: auto;\" data-id=\"1756013534955252607\" data-view=\"home\" data-hide-price=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1756013534955252607?adults=1&amp;s=66&amp;source=embed_widget\" rel=\"nofollow\">View on Airbnb</a><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1756013534955252607?adults=1&amp;s=66&amp;source=embed_widget\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rental unit in Bengaluru · ★5.0 · 1 bedroom · 2 beds · 1 bathroom</a>\n<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/embeddable/airbnb_jssdk\"></script>\n</div>",
