            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161801.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161801-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Living Room</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_162708.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_162708-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Living and Dining Area</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_163001.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_163001-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Dining Room</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165513.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165513-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Dining and Living Area</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165840.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165840-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Balcony</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165809.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165809-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Balcony</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_173458.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_173458-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Balcony</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_164116.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_164116-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>First Bathroom (next to Dining room)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_172513.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_172513-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>First Bathroom (next to Dining room)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165107.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165107-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kitchen</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165126.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165126-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kitchen</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_164732.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_164732-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kitchen Wash Area (Balcony)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165317.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_165317-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>A little welcome treat, on the house! Because check-ins are better with snacks. Unpack, relax and grab a bite.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161201.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161201-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Master Bedroom</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161320.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161320-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Work Desk with Featherlite Chair (in master bedroom)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160647.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160647-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Master Bedroom</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161239.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_161239-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>A little pampering, on the house. Because self-care should travel with you.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160536.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160536-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Second Bathroom (in master bedroom)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160407.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160407-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Second Bathroom</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160509.jpg\" data-size=\"4000x3000\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://serenivue.com/media/posts/4/gallery/20250909_160509-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a>\n<figcaption>Second Bathroom (in master bedroom)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding: 25px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px;\"><address><strong>chez edifice /ʃeɪ ˈɛdɪfɪs/</strong></address><address><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\">ORIGIN: french locution</span></address><address>    1. at one's own place</address><address>    2. at the edifice</address><address> </address><address>A beautiful French idiom that evokes the comfort and belonging you feel in your own home. It's essence is \"a familiar space in an unfamiliar place\" or \"freedom to be yourself without reservation\".</address></div>\n<div class=\"post__toc\">\n<h3>Jump to section:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb86h5eec0\">Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85gmavbp\">Availability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb884ddhdj\">Location / Landmark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85eftdbg\">Amenities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85eftdbh\">House Rules</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#mcetoc_1jb85gmavbq\">Check-in and check-out</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb86h5eec0\">Price</h2>\n<p>Minimum booking duration: 3 days (mandatory).</p>\n<p>For Direct Bookings: INR (Indian Rupees) 4200 per night (for stays less than 7 days).</p>\n<p>Planning to stay for long term? I offer discounts for longer stays (based on stay duration as well as amenities needed). Please <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918982732654&amp;text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20*Chez%20Soi%20(1BHK%20in%20CV%20Raman%20Nagar)*%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fserenivue.com%2Fchez-soi-1bhk-in-cv-raman-nagar.html%0A%0APrimary%20guest%20name%3A%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20guests%3A%20%0A%0ACheck-in%20date%3A%20%0A%0ACheckout%20date%3A%20%0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">connect with me on Whatsapp Chat</a> so that we can discuss the same. </p>\n<p>Important points to keep in mind:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can pay via UPI (if you are from India) or via Paypal (if you are based outside India). Cash payments are not accepted.</li>\n<li>There is no security deposit, but 100% of amount needs to be paid before checkin.</li>\n<li><strong>Refunds and cancellations</strong>: No cancellation and no refunds on direct bookings via this website. If you want a refundable booking, please book via Airbnb as the Airbnb listing for this house has an option for refundable booking (with Airbnb taking charge of enforcing the cancellation policy as well as process refunds).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85gmavbp\">Availability</h2>\n<p>Due to proximity of this flat to some key work centers (Bagmane Tech Park, Godrej Center, Embassy Golf Links, Manipal Hospital to name a few), most of our guests end up extending their stay in this property depending on their work commitments. </p>\n<p>You can message me on <a href=\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918982732654&amp;text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20*Chez%20Soi%20(1BHK%20in%20CV%20Raman%20Nagar)*%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fserenivue.com%2Fchez-soi-1bhk-in-cv-raman-nagar.html%0A%0APrimary%20guest%20name%3A%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20guests%3A%20%0A%0ACheck-in%20date%3A%20%0A%0ACheckout%20date%3A%20%0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Whatsapp with your check-in and checkout dates</a> and I will share availability with you.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\">This house on Airbnb:<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Average Rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</li>\n<li><strong>Guest Favorite</strong> (badge)</li>\n<li><strong>Top 10% of homes</strong> (badge)</li>\n<li><strong>Unbeatable location</strong> (badge)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Checkout Airbnb listing.</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\">\n<p>Hosted by: <strong>Amber Jain</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>SUPERHOST (badge)</li>\n<li class=\"align-left\"><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/users/profile/1468170512243225483\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My Airbnb Host Profile</a></li>\n<li class=\"align-left\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/amberjain/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My Linkedin Profile</a></li>\n<li class=\"align-left\">I speak English and Hindi</li>\n</ul>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://amberja.in/media/posts/24/responsive/Amber-Jain-md.jpg\" alt=\"Amber Jain\" data-is-external-image=\"true\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb884ddhdj\">Location / Landmark</h2>\n<p>The house is located inside \"<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Creators Edifice</strong></span>\" building. <a href=\"https://share.google/UD6XmeS2n3ncYq9Qr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Maps Location of this house</a></p>\n<p>You can use Google Maps to calculate walking/cab distance to any other location in Bangalore (e.g. your office).<a href=\"https://share.google/UD6XmeS2n3ncYq9Qr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p>For security reasons, the flat/house number will be shared (in booking confirmation email) only after the payment is done for the booking.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85eftdbg\">Amenities</h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 id=\"mcetoc_1jb85gmavbq\">Check-in and check-out</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Check-in: 12pm</li>\n<li>Check-out: 10am</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Early check-in and late check-out are at the host’s discretion, depending on other bookings. These requests will only be confirmed 24-48 hours before the relevant check-in or check-out day, as we have to wait until the last moment to see if the room is getting booked by anyone else.</p>\n<h2>Airbnb listing</h2>\n<div class=\"airbnb-embed-frame\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 300px; margin: auto;\" data-id=\"1449271062503407020\" data-view=\"home\" data-hide-price=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1449271062503407020?guests=1&amp;adults=1&amp;s=66&amp;source=embed_widget\">View on Airbnb</a><a href=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/rooms/1449271062503407020?guests=1&amp;adults=1&amp;s=66&amp;source=embed_widget\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apartment in Bengaluru · ★5.0 · 1 bedroom · 1 bed · 2 bathrooms</a>\n<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.airbnb.co.in/embeddable/airbnb_jssdk\"></script>\n</div>",
